"<div class="vz-box"><div class="vz-top"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><rect x="2" y="2.5" width="12" height="11" rx="1.5"></rect><path d="M5 2.5v11M11 2.5v11M2 5.5h3M2 8h3M2 10.5h3M11 5.5h3M11 8h3M11 10.5h3"></path></svg><b>Visualize execution</b><span class="tag live">STEP BY STEP</span><select class="mini"><option value="sum">Slices and the stack</option><option value="grow">How a Vec grows</option><option value="own">Ownership: move, borrow, clone, drop</option><option value="rec">Recursion and stack frames</option><option value="bounds">Bounds checks and panics</option><option value="ovf">Integer overflow</option><option value="str">Strings: rodata, heap and UTF-8</option><option value="moved" selected="">A use after move (compile error)</option></select><div class="seg vz-depth"><button class="">Basic</button><button class="on">Memory</button><button class="">Machine</button></div><label class="vz-pl"><input type="checkbox"> Predict mode</label><span class="sp"></span><button class="vz-x" title="Close (Esc)">×</button></div>
