        <div class="vz-col"><div class="vz-t">Heap</div><div class="vz-mute" style="padding:6px 2px">Nothing on the heap.</div>
        </div></div><div class="vz-sec"><div class="vz-t">Output</div><pre class="vz-out"></pre></div></div></div>
   <div class="vz-foot"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 2l6 3.2-6 3.2-6-3.2z"></path><path d="M2 8.4l6 3.2 6-3.2M2 11.4l6 3.2 6-3.2"></path></svg> A model of a debug build, run in your browser: values and control flow are exact for this Rust subset; addresses are illustrative and the machine notes describe typical x86-64 output. The desktop app traces real binaries.</div></div>"
`;

