n</span>() {</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-10"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">10</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">    <span class="kw">let</span> values = [<span class="num">4</span>, <span class="num">8</span>, <span class="num">15</span>, <span class="num">16</span>, <span class="num">23</span>];</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-11"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">11</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">    <span class="kw">let</span> result = <span class="fn">sum_list</span>(&amp;values);</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-12"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">12</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">    <span class="mac">println!</span>(<span class="str">"sum = {}"</span>, result);</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-13"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">13</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">}</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-14"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">14</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc"> </span></div></div><div class="vz-right" id="vz-right"><div class="vz-card"><div class="vz-h"><span class="vz-ln">step 1 · line 9</span><span class="vz-fn">in <b>main</b></span></div>
      
      
      <div class="vz-n">The process starts: the runtime sets up the main thread and calls <code>main</code>. Its stack frame is the first one.</div>
      <div class="vz-ins"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 1.8a4.2 4.2 0 0 0-2.4 7.6c.5.4.8.9.8 1.5V12h3.2v-1.1c0-.6.3-1.1.8-1.5A4.2 4.2 0 0 0 8 1.8z"></path><path d="M6.4 14h3.2"></path></svg><span>Every <b>stack frame</b> holds the local variables of one call. Heap memory is separate and is only used when something asks for it (a Vec, a String, a Box).</span></div>
      
      <div class="vz-ask"><button class="mini">Ask why</button><div id="vz-askout"></div></div></div><div class="vz-sec"><div class="vz-t">Variables</div><div class="vz-mute">No locals in this frame yet.</div></div><div class="vz-sec"><div class="vz-t">Call stack</div><div class="vz-cs on"><span>0</span>main<small>line 9</small></div></div><div class="vz-sec"><div class="vz-t">Output</div><pre class="vz-out"></pre></div></div></div>
   <div class="vz-foot"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 2l6 3.2-6 3.2-6-3.2z"></path><path d="M2 8.4l6 3.2 6-3.2M2 11.4l6 3.2 6-3.2"></path></svg> A model of a debug build, run in your browser: values and control flow are exact for this Rust subset; addresses are illustrative and the machine notes describe typical x86-64 output. The desktop app traces real binaries.</div></div>"
`;

exports[`visualizer · overlay #viz (golden) > profundidade \`machine\` — memória + contadores + endereços 1`] = `
"<div class="vz-box"><div class="vz-top"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><rect x="2" y="2.5" width="12" height="11" rx="1.5"></rect><path d="M5 2.5v11M11 2.5v11M2 5.5h3M2 8h3M2 10.5h3M11 5.5h3M11 8h3M11 10.5h3"></path></svg><b>Visualize execution</b><span class="tag live">STEP BY STEP</span><select class="mini"><option value="sum">Slices and the stack</option><option value="grow" selected="">How a Vec grows</option><option value="own">Ownership: move, borrow, clone, drop</option><option value="rec">Recursion and stack frames</option><option value="bounds">Bounds checks and panics</option><option value="ovf">Integer overflow</option><option value="str">Strings: rodata, heap and UTF-8</option><option value="moved">A use after move (compile error)</option></select><div class="seg vz-depth"><button class="">Basic</button><button class="">Memory</button><button class="on">Machine</button></div><label class="vz-pl"><input type="checkbox"> Predict mode</label><span class="sp"></span><button class="vz-x" title="Close (Esc)">×</button></div>
   <div class="vz-bar"><button class="mini" title="Step back (←)">◀ Step back</button><button class="mini pri" title="Play / pause (Space)">▶ Play</button><button class="mini" title="Step (→)">Step ▶</button><span class="vz-sl">Speed<input type="range" min="1" max="10" value="5"></span><span class="vz-pg">6 / 31</span><div class="vz-prog"><i style="width:16.666666666666664%"></i><b style="left:10%" class="m"></b><b style="left:36.666666666666664%" class="m"></b><b style="left:50%" class="m"></b><b style="left:100%" class="m"></b></div></div>
   <div class="vz-main"><div class="vz-code" id="vz-code"><div class="vl" id="vl-1"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">1</span><span class="vh" title="1 time(s) so far"><i style="width:50%"></i></span><span class="vc"><span class="kw">fn</span> <span class="fn">main</span>() {</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-2"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">2</span><span class="vh" title="1 time(s) so far"><i style="width:50%"></i></span><span class="vc">    <span class="kw">let</span> <span class="kw">mut</span> v = <span class="ty">Vec</span>::<span class="kw">new</span>();</span></div><div class="vl prev" id="vl-3"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">3</span><span class="vh" title="2 time(s) so far"><i style="width:100%"></i></span><span class="vc">    <span class="kw">for</span> i <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="num">0..6</span> {</span></div><div class="vl cur" id="vl-4"><span class="va">▶</span><span class="vn">4</span><span class="vh" title="2 time(s) so far"><i style="width:100%"></i></span><span class="vc">        v.<span class="fn">push</span>(i * <span class="num">10</span>);</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-5"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">5</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">    }</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-6"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">6</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">    <span class="kw">let</span> <span class="kw">mut</span> w = <span class="ty">Vec</span>::<span class="fn">with_capacity</span>(<span class="num">6</span>);</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-7"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">7</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">    <span class="kw">for</span> i <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="num">0..6</span> {</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-8"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">8</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">        w.<span class="fn">push</span>(i * <span class="num">10</span>);</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-9"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">9</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">    }</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-10"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">10</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">    <span class="mac">println!</span>(<span class="str">"v cap = {}, w cap = {}"</span>, v.<span class="fn">capacity</span>(), w.<span class="fn">capacity</span>());</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-11"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">11</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">}</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-12"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">12</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc"> </span></div></div><div class="vz-right" id="vz-right"><div class="vz-card"><div class="vz-h"><span class="vz-ln">step 6 · line 4</span><span class="vz-fn">in <b>main</b></span></div>
      
      
      <div class="vz-n">Overflow check on <code>*</code> for <code>i32</code>.<div class="vz-m"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 2l6 3.2-6 3.2-6-3.2z"></path><path d="M2 8.4l6 3.2 6-3.2M2 11.4l6 3.2 6-3.2"></path></svg><span>Debug builds check every arithmetic operation and panic on overflow; release builds wrap silently unless <code>overflow-checks = true</code>.</span></div></div><div class="vz-n">Pushed <code>10</code> into <code>v</code>: len 2, capacity 4.<div class="vz-m"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 2l6 3.2-6 3.2-6-3.2z"></path><path d="M2 8.4l6 3.2 6-3.2M2 11.4l6 3.2 6-3.2"></path></svg><span>Writes 4 bytes at buffer + 4, then increments len.</span></div></div>
      
      
      <div class="vz-ask"><button class="mini">Ask why</button><div id="vz-askout"></div></div></div><div class="vz-mem" id="vz-mem"><svg id="vz-arrows"></svg><div class="vz-col"><div class="vz-t">Stack <span class="vz-mute">grows ↓</span></div><div class="vz-frame on"><div class="vz-fh"><b>main</b><span>line 4</span><span class="ad">rsp 0x7ffd3a1c8fd8</span></div><div class="vz-slot" id="vs-0-0" data-ptr="h1">
        <div class="vz-sh"><b>v</b><span class="tag">mut</span><span class="ty">Vec&lt;i32&gt;</span><span class="ad">0x7ffd3a1c8fe8 · 24 B</span></div>
        <div class="vz-hdr"><span><i>ptr</i>b4e010</span><span><i>cap</i>4</span><span><i>len</i>2</span></div>
        </div><div class="vz-slot" id="vs-0-2">
        <div class="vz-sh"><b>i</b><span class="ty">i32</span><span class="ad">0x7ffd3a1c8fd8 · 4 B</span></div>
        <div class="vz-val">1</div>
        </div></div></div>
        <div class="vz-col"><div class="vz-t">Heap</div><div class="vz-blk" id="vh-h1"><div class="vz-sh"><b>Vec buffer</b><span class="ty">len 2 · cap 4</span><span class="ad">0x55d1c2b4e010 · 16 B</span></div><div class="vz-cells heap"><span id="vh-h1-0"><i>0</i>0</span><span id="vh-h1-1"><i>1</i>10</span><span class="spare"><i>2</i>·</span><span class="spare"><i>3</i>·</span></div></div>
        </div></div><div class="vz-sec"><div class="vz-t">Output</div><pre class="vz-out"></pre></div><div class="vz-sec"><div class="vz-t">Counters so far</div><div class="vz-cnt"><div><span>calls</span><b>0</b></div><div><span>max stack depth</span><b>1</b></div><div><span>heap allocations</span><b>1</b></div><div><span>reallocations</span><b>0</b></div><div><span>frees</span><b>0</b></div><div><span>live heap</span><b>16 B</b></div><div><span>peak heap</span><b>16 B</b></div><div><span>bytes copied</span><b>0 B</b></div><div><span>moves</span><b>0</b></div><div><span>bounds checks</span><b>0</b></div><div><span>overflow checks</span><b>2</b></div><div><span>write syscalls</span><b>0</b></div></div><p class="vz-mute">Counted by the model as a debug build would do them; the optimiser removes many checks and frames in release.</p></div></div></div>
   <div class="vz-foot"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 2l6 3.2-6 3.2-6-3.2z"></path><path d="M2 8.4l6 3.2 6-3.2M2 11.4l6 3.2 6-3.2"></path></svg> A model of a debug build, run in your browser: values and control flow are exact for this Rust subset; addresses are illustrative and the machine notes describe typical x86-64 output. The desktop app traces real binaries.</div></div>"
`;

exports[`visualizer · overlay #viz (golden) > renderiza o exemplo \`sum\` no passo 0 1`] = `
"<div class="vz-box"><div class="vz-top"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><rect x="2" y="2.5" width="12" height="11" rx="1.5"></rect><path d="M5 2.5v11M11 2.5v11M2 5.5h3M2 8h3M2 10.5h3M11 5.5h3M11 8h3M11 10.5h3"></path></svg><b>Visualize execution</b><span class="tag live">STEP BY STEP</span><select class="mini"><option value="sum" selected="">Slices and the stack</option><option value="grow">How a Vec grows</option><option value="own">Ownership: move, borrow, clone, drop</option><option value="rec">Recursion and stack frames</option><option value="bounds">Bounds checks and panics</option><option value="ovf">Integer overflow</option><option value="str">Strings: rodata, heap and UTF-8</option><option value="moved">A use after move (compile error)</option></select><div class="seg vz-depth"><button class="">Basic</button><button class="on">Memory</button><button class="">Machine</button></div><label class="vz-pl"><input type="checkbox"> Predict mode</label><span class="sp"></span><button class="vz-x" title="Close (Esc)">×</button></div>
   <div class="vz-bar"><button class="mini" title="Step back (←)">◀ Step back</button><button class="mini pri" title="Play / pause (Space)">▶ Play</button><button class="mini" title="Step (→)">Step ▶</button><span class="vz-sl">Speed<input type="range" min="1" max="10" value="5"></span><span class="vz-pg">1 / 19</span><div class="vz-prog"><i style="width:0%"></i></div></div>
   <div class="vz-main"><div class="vz-code" id="vz-code"><div class="vl" id="vl-1"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">1</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc"><span class="kw">fn</span> <span class="fn">sum_list</span>(numbers: &amp;[i64]) -&gt; i64 {</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-2"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">2</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">    <span class="kw">let</span> <span class="kw">mut</span> total = <span class="num">0</span>;</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-3"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">3</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">    <span class="kw">for</span> n <span class="kw">in</span> numbers {</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-4"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">4</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">        total = total + n;</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-5"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">5</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">    }</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-6"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">6</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">    total</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-7"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">7</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">}</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-8"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">8</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc"> </span></div><div class="vl cur" id="vl-9"><span class="va">▶</span><span class="vn">9</span><span class="vh" title="1 time(s) so far"><i style="width:100%"></i></span><span class="vc"><span class="kw">fn</span> <span class="fn">main</span>() {</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-10"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">10</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">    <span class="kw">let</span> values = [<span class="num">4</span>, <span class="num">8</span>, <span class="num">15</span>, <span class="num">16</span>, <span class="num">23</span>];</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-11"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">11</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">    <span class="kw">let</span> result = <span class="fn">sum_list</span>(&amp;values);</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-12"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">12</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">    <span class="mac">println!</span>(<span class="str">"sum = {}"</span>, result);</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-13"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">13</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc">}</span></div><div class="vl" id="vl-14"><span class="va"></span><span class="vn">14</span><span class="vh" title="0 time(s) so far"><i style="width:0%"></i></span><span class="vc"> </span></div></div><div class="vz-right" id="vz-right"><div class="vz-card"><div class="vz-h"><span class="vz-ln">step 1 · line 9</span><span class="vz-fn">in <b>main</b></span></div>
      
      
      <div class="vz-n">The process starts: the runtime sets up the main thread and calls <code>main</code>. Its stack frame is the first one.</div>
      <div class="vz-ins"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 1.8a4.2 4.2 0 0 0-2.4 7.6c.5.4.8.9.8 1.5V12h3.2v-1.1c0-.6.3-1.1.8-1.5A4.2 4.2 0 0 0 8 1.8z"></path><path d="M6.4 14h3.2"></path></svg><span>Every <b>stack frame</b> holds the local variables of one call. Heap memory is separate and is only used when something asks for it (a Vec, a String, a Box).</span></div>
      
      <div class="vz-ask"><button class="mini">Ask why</button><div id="vz-askout"></div></div></div><div class="vz-mem" id="vz-mem"><svg id="vz-arrows"></svg><div class="vz-col"><div class="vz-t">Stack <span class="vz-mute">grows ↓</span></div><div class="vz-frame on"><div class="vz-fh"><b>main</b><span>line 9</span></div><div class="vz-mute" style="padding:6px 8px">No locals yet.</div></div></div>
        <div class="vz-col"><div class="vz-t">Heap</div><div class="vz-mute" style="padding:6px 2px">Nothing on the heap.</div>
